---
title: "publishTgeDetails (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: caller check
    q_check_auth --> q_check_ended: caller is legionOperator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_ended --> q_check_tge: hasEnded == true
    q_check_ended --> q_revert_not_ended: hasEnded == false
    q_revert_not_ended --> [*]: revert SaleNotEnded
    q_check_tge --> q_set_token: TGE completed
    q_set_token --> q_set_supply: askToken = tokenAddress
    q_set_supply --> [*]: set totalSupply + allocatedTokens, emit TgeDetailsPublished

    note right of q_set_token
        INV-001: askToken can only be set once via publishTgeDetails
        INV-002: askToken must be non-zero address
        INV-003: allocatedTokens must be consistent with investor allocations
    end note
